{"id":628,"education_philosophy":null,"history":null,"facilities":null,"feature_summary":"考える科と探究プロジェクトで思考力を育成","feature_description":"関西大学中等部は、6年一貫教育の中で思考力の育成を学びの基盤に置きます。独自授業「考える科」では水平・垂直思考などのスキルを学び、教科学習で活用し、総合的な学習では課題解決型のプロジェクトに応用します。地域を知るMACHI、地域づくりを考えるMIRAI、自分の未来を考えるMICHIにも取り組み、基礎学力、協働性、道徳的実践力を育てます。","clubs":[{"id":14353,"name":"アイススケート部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.kansai-u.ac.jp/junior/life/active.html","verified_at":"2026-11-16"},{"id":14354,"name":"サッカー部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.kansai-u.ac.jp/junior/life/active.html","verified_at":"2026-11-16"},{"id":14355,"name":"水泳部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.kansai-u.ac.jp/junior/life/active.html","verified_at":"2026-11-16"},{"id":14356,"name":"日本拳法部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.kansai-u.ac.jp/junior/life/active.html","verified_at":"2026-11-16"},{"id":14357,"name":"バスケットボール部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.kansai-u.ac.jp/junior/life/active.html","verified_at":"2026-11-16"},{"id":14358,"name":"ラクロス部（女子）","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.kansai-u.ac.jp/junior/life/active.html","verified_at":"2026-11-16"},{"id":14359,"name":"英字新聞部","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://www.kansai-u.ac.jp/junior/life/active.html","verified_at":"2026-11-16"},{"id":14360,"name":"茶道部","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://www.kansai-u.ac.jp/junior/life/active.html","verified_at":"2026-11-16"},{"id":14361,"name":"華道部","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://www.kansai-u.ac.jp/junior/life/active.html","verified_at":"2026-11-16"},{"id":14362,"name":"吹奏楽部","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://www.kansai-u.ac.jp/junior/life/active.html","verified_at":"2026-11-16"},{"id":14363,"name":"フィールドワーク部","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://www.kansai-u.ac.jp/junior/life/active.html","verified_at":"2026-11-16"},{"id":14364,"name":"マルチメディア部","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://www.kansai-u.ac.jp/junior/life/active.html","verified_at":"2026-11-16"},{"id":14365,"name"